source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Vulnerable to Lightning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Lightning_Vulnerability.png/28px-Lightning_Vulnerability.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Lightning_Vulnerability.png/42px-Lightning_Vulnerability.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Lightning_Vulnerability.png/56px-Lightning_Vulnerability.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Vulnerable to Lightning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Lightning_Vulnerability.png/28px-Lightning_Vulnerability.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Lightning_Vulnerability.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Resistant to all Cold\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Cold_Resistance_Full.png/28px-Cold_Resistance_Full.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/49/Cold_Resistance_Full.png/42px-Cold_Resistance_Full.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/49/Cold_Resistance_Full.png/56px-Cold_Resistance_Full.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Resistant to all Cold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Cold_Resistance_Full.png/28px-Cold_Resistance_Full.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/4/49/Cold_Resistance_Full.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Immune to all Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Psychic_Immunity.png/28px-Psychic_Immunity.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Psychic_Immunity.png/42px-Psychic_Immunity.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Psychic_Immunity.png/56px-Psychic_Immunity.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Immune to all Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Psychic_Immunity.png/28px-Psychic_Immunity.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/4/4f/Psychic_Immunity.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Immune to all Poison\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png/28px-Poison_Immunity.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png/42px-Poison_Immunity.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png/56px-Poison_Immunity.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Immune to all Poison\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png/28px-Poison_Immunity.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Resistant to all Radiant\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Radiant_Resistance_Full.png/28px-Radiant_Resistance_Full.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Radiant_Resistance_Full.png/42px-Radiant_Resistance_Full.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Radiant_Resistance_Full.png/56px-Radiant_Resistance_Full.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Resistant to all Radiant\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Radiant_Resistance_Full.png/28px-Radiant_Resistance_Full.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/4/4f/Radiant_Resistance_Full.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li></ul></div>\n</div></section><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Conditions</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"conditions\" data-item-name=\"conditions\">\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><ul><li><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-title\"><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sturdy_(Condition)\" title=\"Sturdy (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sturdy\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/32/Sturdy_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Sturdy_(Condition)\" title=\"Sturdy (Condition)\"><b>Sturdy</b></a></span></p></div><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-text\"><ul><li>This material is rather strong. Only a hit that deals at least 10 damage can damage it.</li></ul></div></div></li></ul></div>\n</div></section></section>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section></aside>\nThe <b>Incineration Caster</b> is a device in <a href=\"/wiki/Wyrm%27s_Rock_Fortress\" title=\"Wyrm's Rock Fortress\">Wyrm's Rock Fortress</a> which shoots a cone of fire at enemies standing in front of it. \n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>Incineration Casters only become active during combat. After using <a href=\"/wiki/Incinerate_(Incineration_Caster)\" title=\"Incinerate (Incineration Caster)\">Incinerate (Incineration Caster)</a> on a target, it becomes <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Overheating_(Condition)\" title=\"Overheating (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"overheated\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Overheating_(Condition)\" title=\"Overheating (Condition)\">overheated</a> for 3 turns and explodes if triggered again.\n</p><p>When successfully disarming with a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;10 Sleight of Hand Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;10 <a href=\"/wiki/Sleight_of_Hand\" title=\"Sleight of Hand\">Sleight of Hand</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a> roll, the Incineration Caster immediately uses <a href=\"/wiki/Incineration_Caster:_Overheat\" title=\"Incineration Caster: Overheat\">Incineration Caster: Overheat</a>, forcing the character (and everyone close enough) to make a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Dexterity Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a>. As stated in the ability's page, however, everyone affected still takes half-damage, even if they succeed their Saving Throw.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Combat\">Combat</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Attacks_and_actions\">Attacks and actions</span></h3>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-image nomobile\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Fire.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/43/Generic_Fire.webp/100px-Generic_Fire.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/43/Generic_Fire.webp/150px-Generic_Fire.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/43/Generic_Fire.webp/200px-Generic_Fire.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/43/Generic_Fire.webp/100px-Generic_Fire.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/43/Generic_Fire.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-header\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Incinerate_(Incineration_Caster)\" title=\"Incinerate (Incineration Caster)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Generic_Fire_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Fire_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Generic_Fire_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Fire_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Generic_Fire_Icon.webp/80px-Generic_Fire_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Incinerate\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Generic_Fire_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Fire_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Generic_Fire_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Incinerate_(Incineration_Caster)\" title=\"Incinerate (Incineration Caster)\">Incinerate</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-content\">\n<dl><div><div><b>Damage: 10~60</b></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><span style=\"display:block;position:relative;width:30px;height:30px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;margin-right:2px\"><span style=\"z-index:0;position:absolute;transform:translate( 0%, 0%)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/96/D6_Fire.png/27px-D6_Fire.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/96/D6_Fire.png/40px-D6_Fire.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/96/D6_Fire.png/54px-D6_Fire.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/96/D6_Fire.png/27px-D6_Fire.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/96/D6_Fire.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">10d6</span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a></div></div></div></div></dl> Belch a cone of roiling flame on all targets in the area.\n</div> \n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-footer\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-horizontlist\"> \n<dl><dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"DEX Save\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">DEX</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Per turn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: Per turn</dd></dl>\n    </div></div>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<p>If the Incineration Caster is destroyed, it casts:\n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-image nomobile\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Fireball.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1a/Fireball.webp/100px-Fireball.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1a/Fireball.webp/150px-Fireball.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1a/Fireball.webp/200px-Fireball.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1a/Fireball.webp/100px-Fireball.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1a/Fireball.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-header\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Incineration_Caster:_Overheat\" title=\"Incineration Caster: Overheat\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/image